scripts/2026/08/11/hr-block-hrb-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[2,2,0,2.26],"cost_cuts":[5,5,0,5.65],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[1,1,0,1.13]},"move":{"r1":0.1609,"r5":0.0915,"r20":-0.0328,"r1_spy":0.1584,"r5_spy":0.0955,"r20_spy":-0.0222}}],"quotes":[{"c":"HRB 2018 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2018-03-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"In assisted, we continue to expect improvement in our client trajectory, driven by promotional offers and client-experience enhancements, and we are on track to deliver moderate inflationary price increases, as outlined in December.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/07/hr-block-hrb-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2018 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2018-03-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"We went into the year expecting inflationary, kind of modest price increases, and that's exactly what we're delivering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/07/hr-block-hrb-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2018 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2018-06-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"With respect to volume and pricing in our assisted business, we expected an improvement in the client trajectory and moderate inflationary price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/12/hr-block-inc-hrb-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2018 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2018-06-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey J. Jones II","x":"What's the right size threshold?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/12/hr-block-inc-hrb-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2019 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2018-12-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Jones","x":"An extension of this aggressive posture is how we are taking price transparency to another level for the DIY consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/12/06/hr-block-inc-hrb-q2-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2019 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2019-03-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"Turning to the income statement, we are reiterating the outlook we provided the last few quarters as we continue to expect total consolidated revenues of $3.05 billion to $3.1 billion and EBITDA margin of 24% to 26%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/07/hr-block-inc-hrb-q3-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2019 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2019-03-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey J. Jones","x":"So, we're reaffirming our outlook, because we like the momentum we're seeing, but we also know that there are a lot of things that we're doing, brand new this year for the first time and we still see room for improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/07/hr-block-inc-hrb-q3-2019-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2019 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2019-06-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"So, it's a product that's been around for nine years since its inception in 2010 and it's continuing to add team members to invest in R&D, both in artificial intelligence to do auto categorization of different expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/11/hr-block-inc-hrb-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2019 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2019-06-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey J. Jones","x":"While we saw others in the industry continue to raise prices, we focused on winning clients through great value and transparency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/11/hr-block-inc-hrb-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2019 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2019-06-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"And specific to your question on cost savings, I mean, there's a number of moving parts as you can imagine.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/11/hr-block-inc-hrb-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2019 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2019-06-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Millman","x":"Could you tell us what your cost savings are expected to be this year and from what source?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/11/hr-block-inc-hrb-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2020 Q1","e":"hrb","d":"2019-08-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey J. Jones II","x":"We believe that as we continue to rebuild the trust and credibility of the brand, improve the value proposition we believe we can get back to inflationary level price increases in the future, but that's not what we're going to be doing in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/28/hr-block-inc-hrb-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2020 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2019-12-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey J. Jones II","x":"And over time, once that value prop gets clearer and tighter, and we feel like we're back on a path to growth, we expect and hope to be able to get back to inflationary level price increases in the Assisted business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/04/hr-block-inc-hrb-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2020 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2019-12-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey J. Jones II","x":"This year, we'll introduce a variety of enhancements, such as an improved dashboard to streamline how tax pros manage both in office and virtual returns, and document management that makes the process of gathering and sharing tax documents easier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/04/hr-block-inc-hrb-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2020 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2019-12-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey J. Jones II","x":"When they are complete, we expect to see run rate benefit in the cost reduction and also greater ability to serve clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/04/hr-block-inc-hrb-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2020 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2020-03-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey J. Jones","x":"And in payments, we've made key changes to streamline the client onboarding process to assist clients and getting the right product and to gather key information earlier in the process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/05/hr-block-inc-hrb-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2020 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2020-06-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"…offer a few areas of focus, including renegotiating rents with landlords across our retail footprint, implementing a hiring freeze, eliminating merit increases for fiscal '21, examining vendor spend to renegotiate existing contracts, and reducing capital expenditures to only what is necessary.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/06/16/hr-block-inc-hrb-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2020 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2020-06-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"In summary, we've taken prudent steps to adjust to the pandemic, including our modified operating model, line of credit draw, and cost reduction efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/06/16/hr-block-inc-hrb-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q1","e":"hrb","d":"2020-09-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"The reality is they are taking large price increases every year, and so we'll be looking carefully at our pricing strategy as we move forward, more to come there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/09/01/hr-block-hrb-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q1","e":"hrb","d":"2020-09-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"If we're not getting enough credit from the consumer for the price advantage, then where strategically can we take price and be very transparent about it?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/09/01/hr-block-hrb-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q1","e":"hrb","d":"2020-09-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"These reductions include a hiring freeze, the elimination of merit increases, examining vendor spend, renegotiating rent across our retail footprint and limiting capital expenditures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/09/01/hr-block-hrb-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2020-12-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Heather Watts","x":"We're concept-ing new designs and investing in multiple use cases for artificial intelligence.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/09/hr-block-hrb-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2020-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kirk Simpson","x":"About 90% of the dollar volume passing through Wave invoices or around $20 billion annually is not flowing through our payment system right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/09/hr-block-hrb-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2020-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"As we move forward, and we haven't given an outlook for '22 yet on pricing, but our expectation is that we can get back to inflationary level price increases in our assisted business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/09/hr-block-hrb-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2020-12-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Colby Brown","x":"\"Will any of the $100 million to $150 million of targeted cost savings fall to the bottom line?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/09/hr-block-hrb-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2020-12-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"We also know that there's opportunities to grow EBITDA as well and some of those cost savings will drop to the bottom line, and we'll evaluate each of those opportunities on an individual basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/09/hr-block-hrb-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2021-03-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"And we believe as we pay close attention to client satisfaction scores that continue to be very strong, that clients are seeing the value for price paid, and we expect to be able to get back to inflationary level price increases moving forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/09/hr-block-hrb-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2021-03-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"And so we intentionally took price in DIY this year, and you can see that starting to play out in the results to date.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/09/hr-block-hrb-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2021-03-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"Because we have existing assets across Small Business, Financial Products, and Consumer Tax, it is important to emphasize that the investments we are making will be funded through cost savings, with future investments being success-based and tied to revenue growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/09/hr-block-hrb-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2021-06-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"Our share gains show that our value is being recognized in the marketplace, giving us confidence to consider modest price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/06/16/hr-block-hrb-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2021-06-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"You know, in assisted, we anticipate that we'll start taking some price increases in '22.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/06/16/hr-block-hrb-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2021-06-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"I mean, the restructuring did provide some savings, but we're also investing a good portion of that savings in things like the financial products imperative that we talked about.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/06/16/hr-block-hrb-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2021 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2021-06-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jeff Silber","x":"And I know last week, you announced some restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/06/16/hr-block-hrb-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q1","e":"hrb","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"As a result of our significant product and experience improvements, we plan to take modest price increases in Assisted this year, something we'll evaluate annually.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/hr-block-hrb-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q1","e":"hrb","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"And so given what we've seen in volume, given what we've seen in client satisfaction, given what we've seen in retention gains, we feel good about taking that kind of price increase and something we want to look at each year in the Assisted business as we move forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/hr-block-hrb-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q1","e":"hrb","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"Regarding expenses, we were disciplined in achieving our cost savings while appropriately investing in our Block Horizons imperatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/hr-block-hrb-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2022-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"So we think it's a good first step, as we move back into what we believe we can start taking price moving forward in Assisted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/01/hr-block-hrb-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2022-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"So specific to your question on price, as we take price increases, the tax professionals would get an incremental amount for that particular tax return, all else being equal, which would obviously a portion flow due to them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/01/hr-block-hrb-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"We also realized strong growth in net average charge this season of approximately 8%, primarily driven by favorable mix as we serve more complex businesses, and to a lesser extent, low single-digit price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/11/hr-block-hrb-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2022-05-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"The remaining one-third was due to planned modest price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/11/hr-block-hrb-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2022-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"As Jeff shared, financial results continue to be strong across the P&L, and we are increasing our outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/11/hr-block-hrb-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2022-05-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"It's been a great year, and I'm pleased we're able to increase our outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/11/hr-block-hrb-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2022-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"We believe we can grow revenue 3% to 6% annually over time, driven by the many levers we have in place, including about a point from the steady industry growth, a couple of points of modest, low single-digit price increases, a point from franchise buybacks and nearly a point from Wave.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/10/hr-block-hrb-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2022-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Bowen","x":"Obviously, we're in a high inflationary environment, but we've talked about we think that we can take low single-digit price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/10/hr-block-hrb-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2022 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2022-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Jones","x":"Embedded machine learning in the DIY user interface is producing a better experience for customers by streamlining the time to complete their return.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/10/hr-block-hrb-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q1","e":"hrb","d":"2025-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Curtis Campbell","x":"The other thing that we're really excited about is our investment in AI moving forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/hr-block-hrb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q1","e":"hrb","d":"2025-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tiffany Mason","x":"Our first quarter results and full-year plans position us well to reaffirm the outlook we provided in August.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/07/hr-block-hrb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2026-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Paris","x":"And you're still thinking low single-digit price increases across both assisted and DIY?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/hr-block-hrb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2026-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jessica Hazel","x":"AI tools like the AI-tax pro assistant, streamlining manual processes, and enhancing experiences, aim for pros to build relationships, guidance, and coaching.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/hr-block-hrb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q2","e":"hrb","d":"2026-02-03","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Jessica Hazel","x":"Fifty-five percent consistently seek assistance, seeing AI as an opportunity, not a disruptor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/hr-block-hrb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tiffany L. Mason","x":"NAC, in particular, if you unpack that, we took a low single-digit price increase, we used channel, and the rest of that is mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/hr-block-hrb-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Curtis Campbell","x":"Based on our year-to-date performance, we are raising our full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/hr-block-hrb-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tiffany L. Mason","x":"Based on our year-to-date results, including a strong tax season, we have raised our full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/hr-block-hrb-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q3","e":"hrb","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Curtis Campbell","x":"With 70 years built on trust, judgment, and accountability—and decades of real client scenarios and data—we are using AI to amplify expertise, not replace it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/hr-block-hrb-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2026-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tiffany L. Mason","x":"We continue to have pricing power in the, in the industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/hr-block-hrb-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2026-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tiffany L. Mason","x":"We continue to plan for low single digit price increases as we think about fiscal 27, and that is what certainly baked into and inherent in our guidance that we gave today for this next upcoming year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/hr-block-hrb-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2026 Q4","e":"hrb","d":"2026-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Curtis A. Campbell","x":"We are also streamlining supporting functions to better enable our field teams, increase consistency of execution, and accelerate our ability to scale what is working across the organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/hr-block-hrb-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HRB 2